WEBVTT

00:59.613 --> 01:00.758
I'm listening, Tam.

01:02.500 --> 01:04.042
Oh, just stop it, you.

01:04.133 --> 01:06.726
My little girl hasn't met him,

01:06.751 --> 01:08.554
so why this talk about knot-tying?

01:08.579 --> 01:10.663
My boy Lanh's a good one.

01:11.251 --> 01:14.007
Sunrise, he's at work.
Sundown, remedial class.

01:14.032 --> 01:15.532
He doesn't fool around.

01:15.586 --> 01:17.439
Whatever he earns, he keeps.

01:17.663 --> 01:19.243
He doesn't even gamble!

01:19.268 --> 01:21.638
Yes, Cashew,
bring papa 30 million VND!

01:21.663 --> 01:24.846
You're killing me, Banana!

01:27.047 --> 01:27.757
Ouch!

01:28.040 --> 01:29.040
Damn you!

01:31.750 --> 01:32.750
Oh?

01:34.450 --> 01:36.949
Cashew got hit by karmic lightning!

01:36.950 --> 01:38.620
No, no, no, no!

01:40.000 --> 01:40.660
This...

01:40.661 --> 01:42.040
isn't a loss, yeah?

01:42.120 --> 01:42.910
Oh, no, no!

01:42.911 --> 01:44.329
Boys, the rules!

01:44.330 --> 01:46.830
- "The cock that dashes, loses!"
- Yep!

01:46.910 --> 01:49.119
- "The cock that rests, loses!"
- Yep, too!

01:49.120 --> 01:50.369
Now get your boy up,

01:50.370 --> 01:52.619
if he's fine, fight on. If not, he loses!

01:52.620 --> 01:53.250
OK.

01:53.250 --> 01:53.910
Can it though?

01:53.911 --> 01:55.580
Here, I'll get him up.
He's fine, see?

01:55.700 --> 01:57.200
See, he's fine!

01:57.790 --> 01:59.199
Wow, that's real fine, alright!

01:59.200 --> 02:01.119
He's dead and gone!

02:01.120 --> 02:02.080
It's just tired!

02:02.081 --> 02:03.829
- Oh, really?
- Look!

02:03.830 --> 02:05.660
He'll fight on. Witness!

02:06.250 --> 02:08.370
No one hates my son.

02:09.000 --> 02:10.040
He also hates no one.

02:11.040 --> 02:12.789
He has no debts as well.

02:12.790 --> 02:15.290
Give me back my money! Lanh!

02:15.540 --> 02:17.080
You know you owe me, right?

02:17.200 --> 02:19.700
Folks also love
Lanh's bricklaying skills.

02:20.080 --> 02:22.120
- Really?
- He's as strong as an ox.

02:22.910 --> 02:25.200
Stop running or else!

02:26.120 --> 02:27.200
Stop running!

02:27.330 --> 02:29.500
- Grab him!
- You think you can run away from us?

02:30.750 --> 02:31.750
Lanh!

02:31.830 --> 02:33.200
Come here! Lanh!

02:35.500 --> 02:36.500
Argh!

02:37.540 --> 02:39.200
Damn you all!

02:39.620 --> 02:40.790
- Get him!
- I'll get you!

02:42.700 --> 02:45.330
He's just right here!

02:55.620 --> 02:56.620
Damn!

02:56.790 --> 02:59.449
- I just saw him.
- Did we chase a ghost?

02:59.450 --> 03:00.370
Shut it!

03:00.371 --> 03:01.580
Stop talking nonsense!

03:02.200 --> 03:03.200
Let's split up.

03:04.660 --> 03:05.660
Boss, boss, boss!

03:05.950 --> 03:06.950
Could he be...?

03:15.000 --> 03:16.000
Are you dumb?

03:17.107 --> 03:18.107
Go!

03:21.777 --> 03:23.107
He's smarter than that!

03:23.277 --> 03:24.277
Go and search!

03:24.987 --> 03:26.947
3 mil for each if you catch him!

03:37.237 --> 03:41.277
[Le Thi Na 1974 - 1999]

04:30.080 --> 04:36.664
BETTING WITH GHOST

04:36.857 --> 04:38.657
Tam, your daughter...

04:38.737 --> 04:41.156
if she weds Lanh then you will have

04:41.157 --> 04:43.317
a great son-in-law.

04:44.607 --> 04:46.157
- Really?
- Yes...

04:47.777 --> 04:48.777
Who was that?

04:48.857 --> 04:50.567
Your son, who else?

04:50.657 --> 04:53.817
Lanh! Eat something
then go to school.

04:54.697 --> 04:56.446
- Where is he?
- Lanh!

04:56.447 --> 04:57.986
I know where you live!

04:57.987 --> 04:59.856
- Damn you!
- Where's Lanh?

04:59.857 --> 05:02.106
- Come out here!
- Let me see you a little!

05:02.107 --> 05:04.157
Come out now!

05:06.067 --> 05:08.947
Heavens...
What's with all the noise?

05:09.027 --> 05:09.657
Where's Lanh?

05:09.817 --> 05:11.197
Get out here! Stop hiding!

05:11.277 --> 05:12.657
Think I can't find your house?

05:12.947 --> 05:13.947
Old man!

05:15.447 --> 05:16.447
Where's Lanh?

05:16.567 --> 05:17.567
Get him out here!

05:17.817 --> 05:19.737
Please point this way.

05:20.907 --> 05:22.067
You messing with me?

05:22.317 --> 05:23.487
This isn't Lanh!

05:24.777 --> 05:25.777
It's Lanh's dad.

05:26.197 --> 05:27.197
Hi, sir!

05:29.027 --> 05:30.027
Hey, friend!

05:30.067 --> 05:31.236
Screw you, friend!

05:31.237 --> 05:32.777
Now get Lanh out here to pay me!

05:32.907 --> 05:35.987
He lost 30 million VND,
then he took off!

05:36.107 --> 05:37.817
I, Alex, am insulted!

05:38.027 --> 05:39.027
Get him out here!

05:40.987 --> 05:41.987
Uh... I...

05:43.317 --> 05:44.407
- Tam?
- Huh?

05:44.447 --> 05:45.947
Where are you going?

05:46.027 --> 05:49.487
I... I'm going to find
a new man for my girl.

05:49.527 --> 05:51.236
Hey, all! Boys!

05:51.237 --> 05:52.107
Get him out here!

05:52.108 --> 05:53.357
Wait wait!

05:53.607 --> 05:55.157
Let me ask you this...

05:55.317 --> 05:58.317
Have you confused my Lanh
for the one in the next town?

05:58.487 --> 06:00.567
Confused? We don't "canhfuse"
with any "lo... "...

06:02.197 --> 06:03.947
We don't confuse with any Lanh!

06:03.987 --> 06:07.317
For months he's been gambling
and cockfighting! Don't hide!

06:07.777 --> 06:08.987
- Pay us back!
- Wait...

06:09.027 --> 06:11.157
Pay us back! Pay us back!

06:11.237 --> 06:12.817
Thomas! Calm yourself!

06:21.552 --> 06:23.632
- Give it!
- Damn you!

06:23.657 --> 06:25.947
Lanh! Drag him out here!

06:28.527 --> 06:29.317
Move!

06:29.487 --> 06:32.527
Help! Help me!

06:32.559 --> 06:36.524
They're robbing and assaulting!
Robbing and assaulting!

06:36.549 --> 06:39.727
Live the stream and share it
so they go on "sending"!

06:39.752 --> 06:41.542
Sic the netizens on them!

06:41.567 --> 06:44.777
It's "trending."
Not "sending," you fat cow.

06:45.328 --> 06:48.832
What are you looking at?
I'll end you, too. Go to bed!

06:49.527 --> 06:53.051
And you, out here crying wolf?
You're friends with Lanh?

06:53.610 --> 06:55.110
Who's assaulting you? Huh?

06:55.487 --> 06:56.487
Huh?

06:57.027 --> 07:00.422
See? You see? I told you!
They're assaulting me!

07:00.447 --> 07:01.487
Assaulting!

07:05.817 --> 07:06.817
I'm already in pain!

07:07.157 --> 07:09.357
- Damn you all!
- Whoa!

07:09.947 --> 07:11.857
Three youths against one woman?

07:12.447 --> 07:13.776
So what? You're next!

07:13.777 --> 07:15.197
Oh, no! Lanh!

07:15.447 --> 07:16.947
There he is!

07:16.987 --> 07:18.107
Damn you!

07:18.197 --> 07:20.487
Hurt my dad and I'll kill you dead!

07:20.567 --> 07:22.567
Damn you!
What about my money?

07:22.857 --> 07:24.067
One, give me a week.

07:24.407 --> 07:25.567
Two, give me death!

07:25.737 --> 07:27.237
Yes! I'll give you a week!

07:27.487 --> 07:28.527
- Whose week?
- Yours!

07:28.817 --> 07:29.817
Shut the hell up!

07:31.107 --> 07:32.697
And as for you, you dog!

07:32.777 --> 07:35.157
Why not toss your knife
into the ground,

07:35.237 --> 07:36.697
but instead into my leg?

07:38.067 --> 07:38.567
Oh?

07:38.947 --> 07:40.107
What's the reason?

07:40.607 --> 07:43.947
And if you have a week,
I, Alex, am not cruel enough!

07:45.027 --> 07:46.067
Eight days!

07:46.197 --> 07:48.357
You get me yet? Eight days!

07:49.407 --> 07:51.857
You better pay in full! Ah!

07:52.567 --> 07:54.567
- Get me to the ER!
- Yes, yes, yes.

07:54.607 --> 07:55.986
- Damn it to... Ah!
- Hurry up!

07:55.987 --> 07:59.737
Lift yourself up
so you're lighter, come on!

08:04.607 --> 08:07.447
These two months, you skipped work

08:07.697 --> 08:08.777
to go cockfighting!

08:09.607 --> 08:14.527
Come on, dad, I was lured into it.
And I lost just 2 million VND.

08:14.607 --> 08:17.447
Two million? They said 30!

08:17.527 --> 08:20.737
Where do I get 30 million?
Look at us, so how, really?

08:20.987 --> 08:22.487
I'm not done!
Don't walk away!

08:22.567 --> 08:24.697
- I'm walking away to eat.
- Stop it!

08:24.777 --> 08:27.357
He's right. Where could he get
30 million VND to bet?

08:27.657 --> 08:28.817
Do what you need to.

08:28.857 --> 08:30.947
But don't make your late mom
sad due to you!

08:31.237 --> 08:33.737
Nonsense. If she's sad,

08:33.817 --> 08:35.277
you can slap me.

08:35.407 --> 08:38.696
See? She's all cheery.
Cheerier than me, even.

08:38.697 --> 08:40.156
- What are you looking at?
- Stop!

08:40.157 --> 08:41.407
Hurry up now.

08:41.487 --> 08:44.157
- Let me teach him!
- Come to my house and help me make cakes!

08:44.317 --> 08:47.696
I'll tell you this, boy,
you better work to pay them!

08:47.697 --> 08:50.987
You said Lanh is a good boy,
so why scold him on and on?

09:01.197 --> 09:02.197
Mister?

09:03.317 --> 09:04.317
Please help me.

09:17.697 --> 09:18.697
Mister?

09:19.607 --> 09:20.697
Please, mister.

09:21.697 --> 09:22.737
Help me out.

10:28.237 --> 10:29.817
Ghost!

10:29.857 --> 10:33.157
Dad, dad, a ghost in our house!

10:52.067 --> 10:53.067
There! There!

10:54.317 --> 10:56.357
There, in the house! Right there!

10:56.447 --> 10:58.357
In the house! Oh, ghost!

10:58.447 --> 10:59.447
Ghost, ghost, ghost!

11:32.777 --> 11:36.527
Why are you haunting me?
I haven't done anything!

11:37.607 --> 11:38.657
Please help me out.

11:40.027 --> 11:41.987
I've been waiting for years.

11:42.947 --> 11:45.567
Why? Why me? Me, why?

11:46.157 --> 11:49.067
Because you are the only one
who can see me.

11:50.737 --> 11:52.157
Can't see you now! Can't see.

11:53.737 --> 11:54.737
I can't see you.

12:01.947 --> 12:03.657
Dammit...!

12:04.697 --> 12:05.907
If you don't help me...

12:06.237 --> 12:07.987
I will haunt you for life!

12:09.107 --> 12:10.107
Be brave, Lanh.

12:10.777 --> 12:12.027
Stay brave, Lanh!

12:17.817 --> 12:19.277
I won't help you!

12:30.567 --> 12:31.777
- Lanh? Lanh!
- Ghost!

12:31.857 --> 12:33.777
Ghost! Ghost! Ghost!

12:34.567 --> 12:35.567
I'm your dad.

12:36.027 --> 12:37.987
Still standing. Stop screaming.

12:42.567 --> 12:43.737
Get up and go to work.

12:44.737 --> 12:45.857
And give me a ride.

13:07.107 --> 13:09.777
- I'm ready, dad.
- You haven't brushed your teeth!

13:19.237 --> 13:20.777
- Let's go.
- Dear Buddha!

13:30.907 --> 13:32.197
No bricklaying today?

13:33.067 --> 13:34.067
Later.

13:41.907 --> 13:42.907
Here.

13:43.737 --> 13:44.407
What is it?

13:44.408 --> 13:45.987
Take some to cut your debt.

13:48.527 --> 13:49.737
I've more than you!

13:50.907 --> 13:52.777
They're scum,
so I leave them hanging.

13:53.857 --> 13:54.857
Go.

13:55.237 --> 13:57.907
Watch the flags, dad,
or you'll poke someone's eye out.

13:59.107 --> 14:02.607
Folks will avoid these like heck,
I'll be fine.

14:05.317 --> 14:06.317
Miss Sau!

14:06.407 --> 14:08.277
Please get me two red tilapias!

14:08.407 --> 14:09.407
Sure!

14:09.607 --> 14:10.776
How weird.

14:10.777 --> 14:13.277
My red self is here
but he prefers red tilapias.

14:14.447 --> 14:17.197
When you're home today,
please pay off your debt.

14:17.527 --> 14:18.947
Stop gambling, you hear?

14:19.237 --> 14:20.357
I know!

14:21.907 --> 14:25.317
No such thing is
"easy earning, easy living."

14:27.607 --> 14:28.607
Red light!

14:36.697 --> 14:37.946
Hello, officer.

14:37.947 --> 14:42.236
I'm... I'm so sorry, sir.
But it's not my fault.

14:42.237 --> 14:46.607
It's... there! That ghost girl, there.
She's been following me!

14:46.987 --> 14:47.987
There!

14:48.277 --> 14:49.317
That girl got dumped.

14:49.857 --> 14:51.157
She's a regular there.

14:54.157 --> 14:55.317
Oh... sorry, officer.

14:55.947 --> 15:00.856
My son's a horror film fan.
His head is sort of off.

15:00.857 --> 15:01.857
Pardon us.

15:12.407 --> 15:15.317
Drive carefully.
No need to pick me up.

15:15.987 --> 15:19.027
- And please don't...
- Gamble, but work. Alright.

15:31.907 --> 15:33.067
Hello? It's me.

15:34.737 --> 15:37.107
Cockfighting? Sure! But wait!

15:37.407 --> 15:38.947
Will Alex's posse be there?

15:40.027 --> 15:41.027
No?

15:41.487 --> 15:43.737
Then I'll be there. ASAP. Sure!

15:45.817 --> 15:46.907
Lanh?

15:47.487 --> 15:48.487
Please help me out.

16:01.067 --> 16:03.999
I will not let you go.

16:29.067 --> 16:31.157
If you keep doing that, I will keel over.

16:31.607 --> 16:33.107
Why are you haunting me?

16:55.027 --> 16:56.317
Please help me, Lanh.

16:57.107 --> 17:00.317
Help me find my girl
I haven't seen in 25 years.

17:00.697 --> 17:01.777
My gods!

17:01.947 --> 17:05.067
I have work to do!
No time to find your daughter!

17:05.237 --> 17:06.277
Why are you honking?

17:06.987 --> 17:09.277
Never seen someone chatting with ghosts?

17:09.527 --> 17:10.776
If you need money...

17:10.777 --> 17:11.777
I will help you get some.

17:12.907 --> 17:13.907
What?

17:14.027 --> 17:15.777
I, Le Thi Na, am no liar.

17:16.527 --> 17:18.487
Every day, I'll help you get your money.

17:18.567 --> 17:20.857
As for how much,
it depends on your fortune.

17:21.157 --> 17:23.857
Fortune...? How the heck
do I know how much I have?

17:24.067 --> 17:26.697
Heaven and Earth, they know.
Ask and find out.

17:27.237 --> 17:28.357
Get a reading.

17:28.907 --> 17:30.237
OK! Get a reading, yes?

17:31.987 --> 17:34.276
Like moon blocks,
if one's up and one's down...

17:34.277 --> 17:36.066
then it's 100 billion VND for me, daily.

17:36.067 --> 17:37.527
If not, stop bothering me.

17:39.317 --> 17:41.737
See! You'll get me 100...

17:43.857 --> 17:44.857
Too greedy.

17:49.487 --> 17:50.487
10 billion, then.

17:52.157 --> 17:53.487
Still too greedy.

17:56.817 --> 17:57.817
50 million!

17:59.777 --> 18:01.447
Great fortune you have.

18:02.277 --> 18:03.277
Just 30 mil!

18:04.237 --> 18:05.447
Deal. 30 million.

18:05.657 --> 18:06.817
That's all you deserve.

18:06.947 --> 18:09.197
Sure! Better than nothing!

18:09.487 --> 18:10.487
But I must warn you...

18:10.607 --> 18:12.947
Every day, you can only get
at most 30 million.

18:13.027 --> 18:14.507
- If you get more...
- If it's more...

18:14.607 --> 18:17.447
then my fortune
is lessened, yes? All good!

18:18.107 --> 18:19.107
Not yours.

18:19.407 --> 18:21.987
Enriching yourself will
endanger your loved ones.

18:24.197 --> 18:26.357
- What?
- That's under 30 million.

18:26.657 --> 18:29.606
If it's over 30 million,
then your most loved one's fate,

18:29.607 --> 18:30.697
I can't safeguard it.

18:32.567 --> 18:33.567
Nonsense!

18:34.817 --> 18:36.657
You want money, you have to trade.

18:37.067 --> 18:39.777
Nothing is for free! That's law!

18:39.947 --> 18:40.947
What law is this?

18:41.487 --> 18:43.066
You're dealing with the Dead.

18:43.067 --> 18:44.656
Rules of the Dead apply!

18:44.657 --> 18:46.197
Where I am, that is that!

18:46.357 --> 18:47.357
Cast off!

19:04.907 --> 19:06.317
Sorry! Sorry!

19:19.067 --> 19:20.067
See the lady there?

19:21.447 --> 19:22.447
Prove it.

19:22.607 --> 19:24.317
Make her bring her cash to me.

19:24.947 --> 19:27.277
Influencing people, that's not my forte.

19:39.987 --> 19:42.777
You'll get that into someone's eye! Rascal!

19:45.027 --> 19:46.487
I think you're out of turn.

19:48.857 --> 19:49.817
Prize for the target, sir?

19:49.818 --> 19:51.067
Hit it, 20 thousand VND.

19:51.567 --> 19:52.907
Miss it, buy my candy.

19:53.107 --> 19:54.157
I'm down.

20:00.487 --> 20:02.567
Ha! 20, please!

20:04.607 --> 20:06.566
Boy! Why did you hit me?

20:06.567 --> 20:07.906
I'm sorry, sir!

20:07.907 --> 20:09.527
- Huh? What's with this thing?
- Sir.

20:09.817 --> 20:10.817
Second go, sir.

20:20.157 --> 20:21.157
Ouch!

20:21.317 --> 20:25.736
Shoot somewhere else!
Stop aiming at me!

20:25.737 --> 20:27.817
- But I didn't.
- Go somewhere else!

20:27.947 --> 20:29.906
- Yes!
- Hey.

20:29.907 --> 20:31.696
That's all my dad will go through?

20:31.697 --> 20:32.947
Light scheme, light injury.

20:34.237 --> 20:35.237
Deal's on.

20:43.027 --> 20:44.027
Money time!

20:56.627 --> 20:58.377
How we betting?
How we betting?

20:58.667 --> 21:02.007
Me, on Butterfly, 30 mil!
Anyone with me?

21:02.047 --> 21:04.337
- He's on 30 mil!
- Deal's on! Deal's on!

21:05.627 --> 21:06.707
Hold, hold, hold!

21:06.797 --> 21:09.797
Me, on Butterfly,
but just 20 mil! Twenty!

21:12.707 --> 21:13.837
Deal's on!

21:20.417 --> 21:21.417
Just get out!

21:21.547 --> 21:24.127
Please let me in.
I'm just getting my son.

21:24.337 --> 21:25.337
Lanh!

21:30.837 --> 21:31.837
Lanh!

21:32.337 --> 21:33.337
Lanh!

21:34.547 --> 21:35.547
Lanh!

21:36.377 --> 21:37.377
Lanh!

21:38.547 --> 21:39.547
Dad! Dad!

21:40.337 --> 21:41.337
Dad!

21:51.587 --> 21:52.587
Dad!

21:57.627 --> 21:58.627
Oh, heavens!

22:07.667 --> 22:09.167
Bad chicken!

22:10.957 --> 22:12.337
- Bad chicken!
- Na...!

22:12.877 --> 22:14.047
Stop hitting! Stop it!

22:15.507 --> 22:16.587
You watch it, old man.

22:19.627 --> 22:20.837
Dad, are you OK?

22:21.337 --> 22:24.047
Are you OK, Dad?
Dad?

22:27.957 --> 22:28.957
Dad! Dad!

22:31.667 --> 22:33.377
Na! Let it go!

22:35.087 --> 22:36.087
Let go!

22:38.007 --> 22:40.667
Dad, I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

22:41.417 --> 22:44.627
Hey, the chicken has fainted.
Can you try CPR on it?

22:50.587 --> 22:51.587
Dad?

22:51.837 --> 22:52.837
Hey, dad?

22:52.957 --> 22:54.207
Dad! Dad!

22:54.337 --> 22:56.337
- Lanh...
- Yes, dad?

22:56.877 --> 22:58.007
Lanh...

22:58.547 --> 23:01.297
Dad! Dad! Dad!

23:01.667 --> 23:02.667
Lanh...

23:03.587 --> 23:06.127
- Lanh...
- Dad? Dad?

23:08.587 --> 23:10.757
Ouch. Ouch, hurts.

23:13.957 --> 23:14.957
Drink up.

23:20.417 --> 23:21.417
What's up?

23:21.457 --> 23:22.957
Could you be any meaner?

23:24.417 --> 23:27.377
As if my life hasn't been sour,
you give me lime without sugar?

23:27.757 --> 23:29.507
Well, we're out of sugar!

23:29.917 --> 23:31.127
How are you feeling?

23:31.797 --> 23:32.797
It...

23:35.587 --> 23:36.587
What?

23:37.547 --> 23:39.837
How come I was at work,
but now I'm home?

23:40.417 --> 23:42.507
So, I was at work.

23:42.547 --> 23:45.457
Then I heard you fainted,
so I picked you up.

23:48.707 --> 23:50.047
Hey, I remember now...

23:50.627 --> 23:53.207
You skipped work to go cockfighting.

23:58.167 --> 24:00.757
Don't call fire when
there's no smoke, yeah?

24:00.877 --> 24:02.167
Were you dreaming?

24:02.457 --> 24:03.457
Dreaming?

24:04.337 --> 24:06.917
That's it. That's it!
I'm sure you were dreaming.

24:07.127 --> 24:10.506
I was there, making limeade,
and you were asleep, screaming:

24:10.507 --> 24:14.627
"Oh, you were betting on it.
Betting on it, huh? Deal's on! Deal's on!"

24:15.417 --> 24:16.667
Damn, I was dreaming, huh?

24:17.167 --> 24:19.207
- But it's weird.
- What?

24:19.417 --> 24:24.047
I dreamed the venue's guard
was beating me up and down.

24:24.257 --> 24:27.007
He might have even wanted to
bite out my armpit hair.

24:28.257 --> 24:32.046
Then in your dream, you may have
owed people money.

24:32.047 --> 24:34.587
Since you couldn't pay,
they dealt with you.

24:35.167 --> 24:36.257
Hey, but why...

24:36.877 --> 24:38.047
even if it was a dream...

24:38.757 --> 24:42.257
my body hurts for real. A lot!

24:43.297 --> 24:44.297
Stop.

24:44.417 --> 24:46.957
You lie down and rest.
I must go to work.

24:47.047 --> 24:48.627
If not I'll lose the day's pay.

24:48.707 --> 24:50.627
- No, I must work, too.
- Rest, please!

24:50.757 --> 24:52.627
- A funeral needs me.
- Hey.

24:52.957 --> 24:56.337
Just finish the limeade, please.
Don't go anywhere!

24:58.297 --> 25:00.377
You care, kid,
but the caring's strange.

25:07.707 --> 25:08.707
Hurts so much!

25:10.047 --> 25:11.667
Hell of a dream!

25:15.337 --> 25:16.707
Where are you going? Rest.

25:16.837 --> 25:17.837
To work.

25:18.547 --> 25:21.377
- Fine, I'll take you.
- No, I'll go myself.

25:21.507 --> 25:23.627
- Just get on.
- You stay home.

25:24.337 --> 25:26.377
- Can you walk then?
- Of course.

25:33.877 --> 25:34.877
Oh?

25:35.127 --> 25:36.206
Why was he hurt lots?

25:36.207 --> 25:37.837
Brutality of cockfighting.

25:37.917 --> 25:40.707
More serious schemes,
more serious injuries.

25:41.957 --> 25:43.507
Well, then, I quit.

25:43.957 --> 25:45.707
You've signed with the Dead.

25:45.957 --> 25:47.917
You can't change things.

25:49.507 --> 25:52.417
I'd like to change... so that
I, and not dad, will be hurt, can I?

25:52.627 --> 25:53.627
No.

25:54.007 --> 25:55.627
Laws of the Dead are firm.

25:56.417 --> 25:57.417
Unless...

25:57.587 --> 25:58.587
Unless what?

26:00.167 --> 26:01.167
I don't know!

26:01.707 --> 26:03.087
But I've got you money.

26:03.337 --> 26:05.337
Now it's your turn, to get my girl.

26:05.877 --> 26:07.587
But I don't know where to start!

26:09.627 --> 26:11.261
Where is my girl,

26:11.652 --> 26:13.010
Auntie Tu "Bowl"?

26:13.667 --> 26:14.877
Oh, you're awake?

26:17.587 --> 26:18.587
Ms. Le Thi Na?

26:18.707 --> 26:19.707
Your daughter!

26:22.257 --> 26:23.707
Thank you, nurse.

26:26.417 --> 26:30.126
Oh, look! Whose girl is this?
What a cutie.

26:30.127 --> 26:34.587
Such a bright face, bless you!
Oh, she's smiling.

26:35.007 --> 26:36.524
Here, Na. Look.

26:36.548 --> 26:37.809
The baby's smiling.

26:39.394 --> 26:40.030
Na?

26:42.016 --> 26:42.939
Na...?

26:45.486 --> 26:47.616
Please take me to Auntie Tu "Bowl"'s place.

26:47.992 --> 26:49.599
She's the only family I have.

26:50.165 --> 26:52.482
She's in Ma Lo area,
where the laborers live.

26:52.507 --> 26:55.007
Go on the Y Bridge here
and turn right.

27:18.047 --> 27:19.047
Hey, sis.

27:19.957 --> 27:21.417
"Where the laborers live"?

27:22.207 --> 27:23.297
This is it?

27:23.667 --> 27:25.047
That house, over there.

27:25.167 --> 27:27.352
I remember Auntie Tu "Bowl"'s shack has...

27:27.377 --> 27:28.837
a Jamaican cherry tree out front!

27:29.707 --> 27:31.207
How long have you been dead?

27:31.377 --> 27:33.457
- 25 years!
- Dear Buddha!

27:33.667 --> 27:36.297
In 25 years, this place's
been renovated 10 times!

27:36.417 --> 27:37.546
- Home!
- Hey, kids!

27:37.547 --> 27:39.877
- No soccer here.
- Ask the security guard!

27:40.837 --> 27:41.837
Good kiddos.

27:44.877 --> 27:46.257
Hey, sir!

27:46.507 --> 27:47.507
Yes, can I help you?

27:47.917 --> 27:49.457
Know where is Auntie "Ball" Tu?

27:49.707 --> 27:50.707
Tu "Bowl"!

27:51.207 --> 27:52.507
I mean, Tu "Bowl".

27:52.589 --> 27:53.589
Tu "Bowl"...?

27:54.135 --> 27:55.725
Which floor? Which block?

27:56.167 --> 27:57.167
Oh, damn.

27:58.507 --> 28:00.257
The original residents here.

28:00.417 --> 28:02.047
Post-renovation, where are they?

28:02.587 --> 28:06.257
I heard that a few remain.

28:06.917 --> 28:10.917
But... most have gone to
the riverside area in District 7.

28:11.457 --> 28:12.917
Ask around there.

28:22.047 --> 28:24.206
Auntie, you moved here from Ma Lo?

28:24.207 --> 28:26.297
- Yes, what's wrong?
- You know Tu "Bowl"?

28:26.377 --> 28:27.047
No idea.

28:27.337 --> 28:29.627
If you're not eating, go inside!

28:31.007 --> 28:32.627
Tu "Bowl", yes? I know her.

28:35.167 --> 28:36.206
Yes, she's the one.

28:36.207 --> 28:38.587
Jamaican cherry tree,
front of her shack, yes?

28:38.837 --> 28:40.257
- That's right, Auntie!
- Wait...

28:41.797 --> 28:43.707
That's right, Auntie.
Where is she now?

28:44.167 --> 28:46.706
I know her. But I don't know where she is.

28:46.707 --> 28:47.917
She didn't move here.

28:55.207 --> 28:56.457
Dead end. Home, then.

28:56.587 --> 28:57.917
Why so eager to go home, huh?

28:58.507 --> 29:01.087
I'm doing things for you.
You should for me, too.

29:01.417 --> 29:02.587
But where do we go now?

29:03.257 --> 29:04.417
I've been so committed!

29:05.087 --> 29:06.087
- Home!
- Again!

29:07.127 --> 29:10.047
Leave it for tomorrow.
My dad is injured and at home.

29:10.417 --> 29:11.627
As a child...

29:11.837 --> 29:13.047
I'm parent-bound!

29:13.377 --> 29:14.377
Am I right?

29:14.627 --> 29:15.627
Home.

29:16.047 --> 29:17.707
Lotto tickets! Lotto tickets!

29:18.297 --> 29:19.587
- Lotto boy!
- Yes?

29:20.667 --> 29:22.007
Remember the numbers!

29:22.877 --> 29:24.337
It's almost drawing time.

29:24.957 --> 29:26.876
Maybe you only see me as your bank?

29:26.877 --> 29:28.167
Hey...

29:28.377 --> 29:30.087
Don't put it like that!

29:30.457 --> 29:32.297
I'm very responsible.

29:32.457 --> 29:35.957
I'm just... getting more resources
to find your girl.

29:36.337 --> 29:38.257
Why make me the bad guy here?

29:41.917 --> 29:42.917
Hey...

29:44.297 --> 29:45.457
Where are you going?

29:45.837 --> 29:47.256
I'm getting your numbers!

29:47.257 --> 29:48.416
Oh, you don't have to!

29:48.417 --> 29:50.417
But then you won't find my girl!

29:53.167 --> 29:54.167
Jerk!

30:20.917 --> 30:22.207
Such a frail ghost.

30:23.007 --> 30:24.627
You have magic. Use it and fly!

30:25.417 --> 30:26.757
Why do humans believe...

30:27.007 --> 30:28.457
ghosts have magic, huh?

30:28.667 --> 30:30.547
We live and die
by meals and monies, too!

30:30.957 --> 30:34.917
We fight each other
to get our offerings, dearest Lanh!

30:37.547 --> 30:38.547
Why the laugh?

30:39.007 --> 30:42.127
Rather than mocking me,
give me a ride then?

30:56.127 --> 30:58.007
Hey, got the numbers yet?

30:58.167 --> 30:59.757
- Already!
- Hey!

31:00.627 --> 31:01.957
I'll be in that cafe there.

31:02.127 --> 31:03.007
Alright!

31:03.127 --> 31:05.007
Sprint! Faster!

31:37.957 --> 31:39.167
Quite the crowd today.

31:42.707 --> 31:45.507
You're a ghost, not a god,
why cut the line all of a sudden?

31:45.757 --> 31:47.087
- That's right!
- That's right!

31:48.337 --> 31:50.166
Then tell me, why pull my hair?

31:50.167 --> 31:51.546
Argue and I'll poke you.

31:51.547 --> 31:53.167
- Just poke!
- Why wait?

31:54.337 --> 31:55.507
I'll poke you, too.

32:01.087 --> 32:02.087
Watch the road, man!

32:02.127 --> 32:04.207
It's crowded here,
why so fast and furious?

32:04.507 --> 32:05.257
Say what now?

32:05.377 --> 32:07.087
Get in your positions, all.

32:12.127 --> 32:15.917
And now, the lottery drawing
from 24H LLC...

32:18.707 --> 32:19.707
Let the spin begin.

33:30.917 --> 33:31.917
Na, that you?

33:32.167 --> 33:33.207
Who else would it be?

33:33.837 --> 33:35.457
- Here, have a drink.
- Are you mad?

33:36.007 --> 33:37.337
I forgot.
Give it, give it.

33:38.007 --> 33:39.547
You won. Just look.

33:40.627 --> 33:41.627
How lucky!

33:44.507 --> 33:47.297
Oh? You spent the whole day
to win 8th place pot?

33:47.627 --> 33:48.417
Only 1.2 million?

33:48.418 --> 33:50.957
Don't forget your daily limit
of 30 million VND!

33:51.257 --> 33:52.257
You want more?

33:52.957 --> 33:56.046
Look at me now, and you
couldn't even ask me if I'm OK?

33:56.047 --> 33:58.667
- Oh, shit...
- You're ridiculous!

33:58.837 --> 33:59.837
Oh, shit!

34:01.707 --> 34:03.507
Whoa? Hey?
Where are you going?

34:04.087 --> 34:05.877
Hey! Where are you going?

34:05.957 --> 34:06.957
Take me with you!

34:11.167 --> 34:12.167
Dad, dad, dad!

34:21.377 --> 34:23.047
Oh, you're back?

34:28.457 --> 34:29.547
Why the stare?

34:32.757 --> 34:33.837
Do I look that fresh?

34:36.127 --> 34:38.587
Already home, yet the house's still dark...

34:55.547 --> 34:57.707
Lottery isn't brutal, so why
is dad that injured?

34:58.007 --> 35:00.667
I ruined others' schemes to fulfill yours!

35:00.837 --> 35:02.337
He must be hurt in return.

35:02.877 --> 35:04.957
Today's take is light, so some light pain!

35:06.047 --> 35:07.047
Deal's off!

35:07.377 --> 35:09.127
Hey! Stop being so selfish!

35:09.457 --> 35:12.257
For today, you have something.
I have nothing!

35:13.167 --> 35:15.007
But you're the one complaining!

35:15.207 --> 35:17.757
Want to break our deal?
I'll haunt you for life!

35:17.957 --> 35:18.957
I'm mad now!

35:21.297 --> 35:22.297
Begone!

35:47.877 --> 35:48.877
What now?

35:49.047 --> 35:50.507
Have some cash, dad.

35:51.207 --> 35:52.457
Use that for your debt.

35:52.797 --> 35:53.797
Take it.

35:56.297 --> 35:57.627
Save it for your wife.

36:03.667 --> 36:05.087
But if you really care,

36:05.207 --> 36:08.127
you save it and take us to Phu Quoc.

36:08.667 --> 36:11.507
Nice beaches there, I hear.
I haven't been.

36:14.127 --> 36:15.327
Wait, those sweet potatoes...!

36:16.007 --> 36:17.547
I bought them for Miss Sau.

36:19.707 --> 36:21.547
Take it easy, or you'll choke.

36:24.457 --> 36:25.917
Go shower, too.

36:26.007 --> 36:28.377
I'll get the fish from her
and we'll have dinner.

36:48.797 --> 36:50.047
You have that much...

36:50.757 --> 36:52.047
then pay off your debt.

39:16.627 --> 39:17.667
Lanh, time for work!

40:01.667 --> 40:02.667
Oh, Lanh?

40:05.457 --> 40:06.707
Please, I beg you.

40:08.087 --> 40:09.667
You're firm about haunting me, huh?

40:11.167 --> 40:13.707
Last night, I was too scared
to go anywhere.

40:14.207 --> 40:17.207
I fear... if you could
no longer see me...

40:17.837 --> 40:20.007
then I'll lose all means to find my girl.

40:21.297 --> 40:23.957
Damn, I don't get it!
You are dead...

40:24.207 --> 40:26.007
so why this need to find her?

40:27.207 --> 40:28.207
I...

40:28.917 --> 40:31.507
I only want to see her just once.

40:32.087 --> 40:34.167
See how she has grown.

40:34.757 --> 40:36.047
How her life has been.

40:38.167 --> 40:39.297
But for what?

40:39.957 --> 40:41.457
Because I'm a mother!

40:56.417 --> 40:58.127
Why did karma tag you up with me...!

40:58.627 --> 40:59.627
Let's go.

41:03.627 --> 41:04.707
I'm off to work, dad!

41:08.257 --> 41:10.087
- Home from the market, Mrs. Nam?
- Yes!

41:20.297 --> 41:22.667
Why do you seek out
cash from cockfighting?

41:23.377 --> 41:25.377
It doesn't require investment.

41:25.507 --> 41:28.047
I've no money.
So I can bet any number.

41:28.757 --> 41:30.127
But what if you lose?

41:30.507 --> 41:33.336
I lose, I leave.
When I win, I'll pay that debt.

41:33.337 --> 41:34.757
Nature of gambling.

41:35.257 --> 41:39.417
Can't be that simple, is it?
People will be out for your blood!

41:39.797 --> 41:42.047
Well, I have you now.
Why should I worry?

41:42.627 --> 41:44.837
We're done, yeah?
Why so many questions?

41:50.627 --> 41:52.127
Alex, there he is!

41:52.417 --> 41:53.837
- Ah!
- Let's go the other way.

41:54.297 --> 41:57.667
Because you stabbed my leg,
I won't give you your eight days, bitch!

41:58.587 --> 42:02.087
That's right, run! Just run!
If I see your old man, I'll snap his legs!

42:06.797 --> 42:08.707
OK, OK! Come here and meet me!

42:08.957 --> 42:10.337
Stop, forget about them!

42:11.297 --> 42:12.297
Lanh!

42:17.877 --> 42:20.047
Let's see who has bigger balls!

42:20.207 --> 42:21.587
You crash, we burn!

42:21.797 --> 42:22.507
Boys.

42:22.797 --> 42:23.797
Hey, boys!

42:26.837 --> 42:28.587
Let go of my arms!

42:28.797 --> 42:30.087
We're here with you!

42:30.207 --> 42:31.707
But I'm in the middle!

42:31.957 --> 42:33.337
Screw you and you, too!

42:33.837 --> 42:36.707
Screw you both to hell!
He's really close!

42:37.797 --> 42:39.207
Screw your mot...!

42:43.877 --> 42:44.877
Where's Alex?

42:46.587 --> 42:47.587
There.

42:50.127 --> 42:54.917
Lanh, it's just gambling money.
We can talk about this, yes?

42:56.297 --> 42:59.416
Lanh! Look out in front,
safety first, Lanh!

42:59.417 --> 43:01.626
Let me tell you something!

43:01.627 --> 43:05.207
Can we stop to get a helmet,
and then we continue?

43:06.047 --> 43:09.416
Lanh, no one's behind you!
Folks are in front!

43:09.417 --> 43:16.047
Lanh, I'm a model citizen, pal.
Stop revving. You'll kill me, man!

43:16.207 --> 43:18.337
Lanh! Lanh!

43:18.797 --> 43:19.457
Lanh!

43:19.458 --> 43:20.877
Let me off!

43:22.207 --> 43:23.757
Damn you! You dog!

43:23.917 --> 43:25.297
Go down and fish him out.

43:25.507 --> 43:27.337
- Maybe not.
- I said "off" so I can walk off.

43:27.507 --> 43:28.667
Not so I can swim!

43:29.507 --> 43:31.877
I will see your face again!
Don't test me!

43:32.297 --> 43:33.297
Don't test me, yeah?

43:38.707 --> 43:41.417
Mr. Dao, tell your son
to pay me 30 mil VND!

43:41.547 --> 43:42.587
You thief!

43:42.837 --> 43:45.507
You owe him 30,
yet you told me 2.

43:46.047 --> 43:48.456
- What else are you hiding?
- Help me up or not?

43:48.457 --> 43:50.416
You skip work today for gambling?

43:50.417 --> 43:51.626
Mr. Dao please!

43:51.627 --> 43:52.167
Home!

43:52.168 --> 43:53.706
- Hear me out, dad.
- Grab me instead!

43:53.707 --> 43:55.587
Hear you feeding me more lies? Home!

43:56.127 --> 43:59.087
Let me ask you: If folks give
you cash, will you take it?

44:23.127 --> 44:25.877
If you have ghostly help, prove it to me.

44:25.957 --> 44:26.957
See if I'll get hurt.

44:31.007 --> 44:32.757
Try and endure a bit, yeah?

44:35.087 --> 44:36.417
Endure a bit or a lot?

44:37.167 --> 44:38.167
Whatever.

44:39.507 --> 44:41.957
Me, on Butterfly, 30 mil. Any takers?

44:44.547 --> 44:45.547
30 mil will hurt a lot.

44:46.297 --> 44:47.507
Let me bring it down.

44:48.837 --> 44:50.547
On Butterfly, 20 mil.
Any takers?

44:51.127 --> 44:52.837
- Who's OK with the bet?
- Deal's on!

45:14.917 --> 45:16.837
Lady Diep, Master Nghi,
please take a seat.

45:21.047 --> 45:23.377
Bet is on, 20 million VND,
OK, young sir?

45:25.007 --> 45:26.547
It's 20 million! Call it off!

45:26.957 --> 45:28.086
- We can't!
- Home!

45:28.087 --> 45:30.877
But the bet is on.
If we're off, we'll lose.

45:40.457 --> 45:41.457
Hey!

45:41.707 --> 45:43.007
There's no signal yet!

45:45.917 --> 45:46.917
You will be fine.

45:47.707 --> 45:48.757
- It's all good.
- Three.

45:48.837 --> 45:50.667
Two! One!

45:50.837 --> 45:51.917
Let them go!

46:09.877 --> 46:11.297
Is it a boy or a girl?

46:12.457 --> 46:13.547
It's a girl.

46:15.007 --> 46:17.337
A girl, forget it.
A boy, keep it.

46:18.087 --> 46:19.667
But it's our child, babe.

46:21.507 --> 46:22.627
What do you want to do?

46:26.337 --> 46:27.457
To keep her.

46:31.547 --> 46:32.917
Then you're on your own.

46:39.047 --> 46:40.126
You vile thing, you bastard!

46:40.127 --> 46:44.127
Why aren't you dead,
why are you still here?

46:44.257 --> 46:45.757
Wait, Butterfly...

46:46.587 --> 46:47.917
Na! Na! Na...!

46:48.417 --> 46:49.417
Na! Na!

46:49.917 --> 46:51.667
Na! Butterfly is fainting.

46:53.417 --> 46:54.417
Na! Na!

46:54.457 --> 46:55.457
Na!

46:55.587 --> 46:56.207
Na!

46:56.547 --> 46:57.547
Na!

47:00.297 --> 47:01.047
Match ends!

47:01.048 --> 47:02.087
Cashew wins!

47:09.837 --> 47:11.587
Oh, Lanh, you...!

47:12.207 --> 47:14.547
How many coffins must
I must bear now to get 20 million?

47:16.587 --> 47:17.917
It's only 20 mil!

47:18.087 --> 47:19.087
Hey!

47:20.797 --> 47:21.837
Hurry up now.

47:22.087 --> 47:23.167
Be my first payer.

47:24.877 --> 47:26.417
OK, big bro.

47:26.667 --> 47:27.667
Run, dad.

47:29.087 --> 47:30.257
A runner!

47:30.507 --> 47:31.627
Stop him!

47:41.167 --> 47:42.167
Faster, dad!

47:42.837 --> 47:43.837
Oh?

47:45.627 --> 47:47.047
Where are you taking me?

47:49.087 --> 47:50.087
Where's my dad?

47:50.877 --> 47:52.957
Presenting me to your daddy?

47:53.877 --> 47:54.707
Oh, no, dad!

47:54.877 --> 47:56.707
Dad! Dad!

47:57.087 --> 47:58.087
Dad!

48:02.757 --> 48:03.757
There he is!

48:06.837 --> 48:08.337
Why are you running with me?

48:09.377 --> 48:10.757
You're with him, huh?

48:12.337 --> 48:13.337
You dog!

48:13.797 --> 48:15.456
- Where is my boss's money?
- Think you can hide from us?

48:15.457 --> 48:16.627
Stop hitting him!

48:16.757 --> 48:17.957
Let us join, too!

48:19.627 --> 48:21.047
Damn you! Still think you can run?

48:24.507 --> 48:25.587
Enough!

48:27.507 --> 48:28.757
I'll pay!

48:30.507 --> 48:33.797
Old debt, 30 million.
New, 20 million. Total, 50 million!

48:33.917 --> 48:35.957
Daily interest is 350 grand!

48:36.127 --> 48:37.587
When did you slip and slide, kid?

48:37.757 --> 48:39.877
I want money.
I need money.

48:40.047 --> 48:41.297
I need lots of money!

48:44.087 --> 48:46.007
You need money, then you study.

48:46.167 --> 48:47.757
Only studies will create change!

48:47.957 --> 48:48.957
You look there!

48:49.127 --> 48:50.837
Your dream is still out of the frame!

48:51.417 --> 48:52.587
You once promised me...

48:52.667 --> 48:55.297
you will work and also study,
to get your diploma!

48:55.917 --> 48:57.297
What happened to it?

48:57.547 --> 48:58.707
Where's that promise?

48:58.797 --> 48:59.797
Forgotten.

49:05.297 --> 49:07.257
You may forget everything...

49:07.507 --> 49:09.797
but you must remember your promise!

49:11.207 --> 49:13.587
Look at us, promises are luxuries.

49:16.707 --> 49:18.127
Enough arguing with you.

49:18.207 --> 49:21.047
Starting today,
you'll follow me all 24 hours.

49:21.127 --> 49:22.917
Work so you can pay your debts!

49:23.127 --> 49:25.007
As for studying, you'll stick to it!

49:27.627 --> 49:28.667
Am I clear or not?

49:31.087 --> 49:32.087
Lanh!

49:33.377 --> 49:34.416
I'll be in the toilet.

49:34.417 --> 49:35.587
And I'll be outside.

49:35.837 --> 49:37.707
Better be quick, or I'll beat your ass!

49:54.047 --> 49:58.007
Na, Na, Na, Na, Na...

49:58.417 --> 50:02.337
Neat you're dead, Na,
since I wanna end ya...!

50:03.797 --> 50:05.917
I'm so sorry... Back there...

50:07.047 --> 50:08.047
Shut it!

50:08.507 --> 50:12.167
How much have you scored for me?
21.2 mil! What is left now?

50:13.757 --> 50:14.837
You...

50:15.547 --> 50:17.547
You'll give me a chance
to make it up, yes?

50:18.257 --> 50:19.627
- Back there, I...
- Leave!

50:20.917 --> 50:22.377
You brat. Who has to leave?

51:10.757 --> 51:11.797
Let me do it.

51:12.837 --> 51:13.837
Hey!

51:14.757 --> 51:15.757
Let me do it.

53:08.917 --> 53:09.917
I'll do it.

53:10.757 --> 53:11.877
You'll hit your hand.

53:23.087 --> 53:24.917
I see that you're hurt for your dad.

53:26.507 --> 53:29.257
To pay everything, you'll need a large sum.

53:30.087 --> 53:33.507
Finding money this way,
when will that sum show up?

53:34.917 --> 53:37.126
I think for this round,
your dad will be alright.

53:37.127 --> 53:40.337
It won't hurt as much as before.
Trust me on this.

53:45.667 --> 53:47.627
I'm giving you one last chance.

53:47.797 --> 53:49.047
- One la...
- Yes.

53:49.087 --> 53:50.457
I know. I know.

53:54.047 --> 53:56.417
30 mil VND for Banana!

53:57.257 --> 53:58.667
Yeah! 30 mil!

53:59.797 --> 54:00.457
Hey!

54:00.707 --> 54:02.007
- Heavens!
- Are you blind?

54:02.547 --> 54:04.377
- So rude!
- Watch where you go old hag!

54:05.957 --> 54:09.087
Auntie Tu! Auntie!

54:10.507 --> 54:11.507
Auntie Tu "Bowl"!

54:12.257 --> 54:13.297
Oh, Auntie!

54:14.707 --> 54:15.707
Lanh!

54:16.087 --> 54:17.587
Lanh! It's Auntie!

54:18.167 --> 54:19.417
It's my Auntie, Lanh!

54:20.757 --> 54:22.707
Go, go, go!

54:24.837 --> 54:25.837
Lanh!

54:29.047 --> 54:30.047
Auntie Tu!

54:35.007 --> 54:36.007
Na!

54:37.047 --> 54:38.047
Na!

54:42.957 --> 54:44.587
Na! Na! Na!

54:44.757 --> 54:45.757
Na!

54:46.797 --> 54:49.007
Lanh! Where is my 30 mil?

54:51.917 --> 54:52.507
Lanh!

54:52.547 --> 54:54.957
Na! Did I mistreat you
in my past life or what?

54:55.627 --> 54:57.877
Lanh! Always, why are you running?

54:58.457 --> 54:59.797
Stop running for once!

55:00.457 --> 55:02.257
I'm not fit for running, Lanh!

55:02.877 --> 55:03.877
Lanh!

55:04.377 --> 55:07.017
- Why are you still running?
- I'll kick your butt if I catch you!

55:07.047 --> 55:08.297
Get him!

55:09.837 --> 55:11.837
Don't jump, just pay!

55:13.377 --> 55:15.667
Pay me back!

55:19.087 --> 55:20.087
Lanh!

55:22.547 --> 55:25.207
Mrs. Nam? Have you seen my son?

55:25.297 --> 55:26.507
I haven't!

55:27.957 --> 55:30.087
Hey! Hi, friend!

55:30.957 --> 55:31.757
Hello, sir.

55:31.837 --> 55:34.377
Our first ask for you is,
"May we get our interest?"

55:41.047 --> 55:42.047
Thanks.

55:43.917 --> 55:45.457
I'll also let you know, friend...

55:45.507 --> 55:49.257
Your son also lost another 30 million.
Take care of that interest.

55:49.297 --> 55:50.297
- What now?
- Correct!

55:50.587 --> 55:52.107
He just jumped off the Ong Leo bridge.

55:52.587 --> 55:54.007
If he dies...

55:54.337 --> 55:55.337
we're square.

55:55.338 --> 55:56.666
If he's alive...

55:56.667 --> 55:58.087
you pay, you hear?

55:58.877 --> 56:00.046
You pay, you hear?

56:00.047 --> 56:02.257
Mister Dao! Mister Dao!

56:02.957 --> 56:04.876
Hey, turns out he's really lucky!

56:04.877 --> 56:07.456
- Son's a good one!
- To get interest.

56:07.457 --> 56:11.417
And yet so bold.
Such fortunes they have!

01:00:50.587 --> 01:00:53.337
[Food stall]

01:01:47.337 --> 01:01:48.337
Lanh!

01:01:48.587 --> 01:01:50.337
Miss Sau! Miss!

01:01:50.507 --> 01:01:51.507
Yeah?

01:01:51.707 --> 01:01:52.837
Unchain me, Miss Sau!

01:01:53.007 --> 01:01:55.507
I unchain you, then your dad
will chain me...?

01:01:55.587 --> 01:01:56.917
I need the bathroom bad.

01:01:57.087 --> 01:01:59.797
- I need it, Miss Sau.
- Let me get the bedpan.

01:01:59.877 --> 01:02:01.007
No, Miss.

01:02:01.257 --> 01:02:02.507
I'm a grown-up.

01:02:02.587 --> 01:02:04.797
Let me go in there for a bit...

01:02:04.957 --> 01:02:05.957
Besides...

01:02:06.047 --> 01:02:10.207
The main door, you've locked it.
I won't be able to run.

01:02:10.297 --> 01:02:11.587
Unchain me, Miss Sau.

01:02:11.667 --> 01:02:12.707
Can you hold it in?

01:02:13.127 --> 01:02:15.457
Please help me, Miss Sau...

01:02:15.757 --> 01:02:17.297
He will kill me.

01:02:23.547 --> 01:02:24.757
Alright, alright.

01:02:51.587 --> 01:02:53.757
Huh? Lanh, what are you doing?

01:02:53.877 --> 01:02:55.457
- Stop it!
- It's fine, Miss Sau.

01:02:56.087 --> 01:02:57.756
Your dad will kill me!

01:02:57.757 --> 01:02:59.207
No, Lanh. No!

01:02:59.547 --> 01:03:00.127
No!

01:03:00.337 --> 01:03:01.207
Miss Sau?

01:03:01.257 --> 01:03:02.917
Stop! Give it to me!

01:03:03.007 --> 01:03:05.207
Stop, I...! Ouch!

01:03:06.547 --> 01:03:07.957
Are you OK, Miss Sau?

01:03:08.627 --> 01:03:09.627
Miss Sau!

01:03:10.757 --> 01:03:12.627
Open the door, Miss Sau!

01:03:13.547 --> 01:03:14.547
Lanh!

01:03:14.757 --> 01:03:15.837
Miss Sau!

01:03:17.877 --> 01:03:20.006
Lanh, no, Lanh!

01:03:20.007 --> 01:03:21.546
Your dad's gonna kill you.

01:03:21.547 --> 01:03:24.667
Lanh, no, Lanh!

01:03:27.087 --> 01:03:28.337
Miss Sau!

01:03:29.297 --> 01:03:30.297
Open the d...!

01:03:42.757 --> 01:03:45.007
Lanh!

01:03:52.297 --> 01:03:53.297
Lanh!

01:03:53.377 --> 01:03:55.337
Lanh!

01:03:55.757 --> 01:03:57.457
Don't leave us, Lanh...

01:04:22.257 --> 01:04:23.547
Mom!

01:04:25.877 --> 01:04:27.297
Please take me with you.

01:04:30.457 --> 01:04:32.087
I'm such a loser.

01:04:34.507 --> 01:04:35.797
I want this to end.

01:04:59.127 --> 01:05:00.127
Damn!

01:05:09.337 --> 01:05:11.957
I wish you could hurt me

01:05:13.047 --> 01:05:15.797
just so it pleases you.

01:05:17.207 --> 01:05:19.797
I know how much pain
you've gone through.

01:05:20.507 --> 01:05:21.507
What was that?

01:05:22.167 --> 01:05:23.627
You know how I what?

01:05:25.087 --> 01:05:27.457
You know my pain?

01:05:28.007 --> 01:05:30.256
- I didn't want to hurt you.
- I have to thank you.

01:05:30.257 --> 01:05:32.296
- I saw my Auntie.
- Thanks to you, I'm in debt.

01:05:32.297 --> 01:05:34.916
- I was so happy. I ran after her.
- Thanks to you, I'm on the run.

01:05:34.917 --> 01:05:37.376
- I want to see my girl.
- Thanks to you, I'm in hell!

01:05:37.377 --> 01:05:40.087
- I've been waiting, 25 years.
- All thanks to you, you hear?

01:05:40.377 --> 01:05:43.232
My only dream is to know
if my girl is alive or dead!

01:05:43.257 --> 01:05:44.020
Shush!

01:05:47.507 --> 01:05:49.007
- Lanh...
- Shush!

01:05:51.377 --> 01:05:52.707
Stop bothering me!

01:05:58.047 --> 01:05:59.797
I will no longer be nice!

01:06:01.257 --> 01:06:02.257
Lanh!

01:06:04.007 --> 01:06:07.257
If there's a chance to
see your mother one last time...

01:06:07.547 --> 01:06:09.127
will you take it?

01:06:09.917 --> 01:06:11.507
Please understand my plight.

01:06:18.417 --> 01:06:22.337
[Here lies
Mrs. Nguyen Thi Be]

01:07:18.337 --> 01:07:20.047
Have you thought this through?

01:07:20.667 --> 01:07:22.047
You're really moving out?

01:07:23.757 --> 01:07:24.917
It's the only way...

01:07:25.917 --> 01:07:28.706
to get away from
Lanh's horrible bunch.

01:07:28.707 --> 01:07:31.417
The three years since
I've moved here...

01:07:31.797 --> 01:07:33.207
I only talk to you.

01:07:33.297 --> 01:07:35.047
But if you decide to move,

01:07:35.257 --> 01:07:37.087
I will also lose a kindred spirit.

01:07:39.047 --> 01:07:40.047
Oh, well.

01:07:40.167 --> 01:07:43.257
Whenever you crave something,
see me and I'll cook it.

01:07:43.797 --> 01:07:45.167
Not sure about the cooking.

01:07:46.007 --> 01:07:47.957
If I crave something, it's you.

01:07:49.797 --> 01:07:50.377
Stop!

01:07:50.667 --> 01:07:53.957
Got your wires crossed?
If Lanh hears this, he'll laugh to death.

01:07:54.297 --> 01:07:55.297
You bitch!

01:08:14.627 --> 01:08:15.627
Hey, Miss Hai?

01:08:16.507 --> 01:08:18.337
The clean-up crew missed a spot!

01:08:18.967 --> 01:08:20.376
- What's that now?
- Hey, sir...

01:08:20.377 --> 01:08:21.717
Is Miss Tu "Bowl" home?

01:08:28.547 --> 01:08:30.297
[Rest in peace miss Tu "Bowl"]

01:08:34.127 --> 01:08:35.052
She caught a cold.

01:08:35.077 --> 01:08:37.156
And she lived alone, no relatives,

01:08:37.967 --> 01:08:40.399
so some of us stepped in
to lay her to rest.

01:08:42.007 --> 01:08:43.167
Her altar's inside.

01:08:43.627 --> 01:08:44.907
Light some incense, if you wish.

01:09:13.797 --> 01:09:14.797
Na?

01:09:15.130 --> 01:09:17.920
I've an idea. Miss Tu "Bowl"
is gone now.

01:09:18.291 --> 01:09:20.995
I believe you can talk to her.

01:09:22.507 --> 01:09:23.967
We'll go to her grave,

01:09:24.167 --> 01:09:25.417
and ask her about the girl.

01:09:25.877 --> 01:09:27.466
Ask about your late baby.

01:09:27.467 --> 01:09:28.467
Yeah.

01:09:37.467 --> 01:09:38.467
Sir?

01:09:39.047 --> 01:09:41.467
Where is Miss Tu buried?

01:09:41.797 --> 01:09:43.087
She wasn't buried. Cremated.

01:09:46.087 --> 01:09:49.257
So her ashes...
which temple did we send to?

01:09:49.797 --> 01:09:51.297
Already scattered.

01:09:53.167 --> 01:09:54.377
Any more questions?

01:09:55.917 --> 01:09:56.917
That's it.

01:09:57.587 --> 01:09:58.587
Thank you.

01:10:20.917 --> 01:10:22.127
I think Heaven...

01:10:23.547 --> 01:10:25.837
doesn't want me to see my girl.

01:10:30.837 --> 01:10:32.837
It's also time for me to depart.

01:10:39.467 --> 01:10:40.717
I'm so, so sorry.

01:10:43.047 --> 01:10:45.967
I was only thinking of my girl and I,

01:10:46.627 --> 01:10:49.127
and so I pushed you into making money.

01:10:50.297 --> 01:10:51.297
To the point...

01:10:51.667 --> 01:10:53.167
you have a debt atop a debt.

01:10:53.877 --> 01:10:55.377
Now why are you sorry?

01:10:57.377 --> 01:10:59.007
I didn't do any thinking at all.

01:11:01.837 --> 01:11:03.877
I believed my dad would only
be hurt for a bit,

01:11:05.337 --> 01:11:07.087
so then I could score a lot.

01:11:08.627 --> 01:11:09.837
I got greedy.

01:11:11.417 --> 01:11:13.217
I'm one rotten son.

01:11:21.337 --> 01:11:23.717
Well... you take care now.

01:11:26.047 --> 01:11:28.087
Love your dad a bit more.

01:11:29.167 --> 01:11:30.547
Stop gambling, too.

01:11:32.257 --> 01:11:34.297
You keep blowing people off,

01:11:35.087 --> 01:11:36.507
one day you won't be so lucky,

01:11:37.007 --> 01:11:38.297
and folks will kill you.

01:11:46.337 --> 01:11:47.917
My life isn't worth a damn.

01:11:52.087 --> 01:11:53.377
I found out that...

01:11:54.467 --> 01:11:56.796
gambling is the quickest way to get rich.

01:11:56.797 --> 01:11:58.757
Getting rich by breaking the law?

01:11:59.337 --> 01:12:00.467
What's good there?

01:12:01.797 --> 01:12:03.047
You have a proper job.

01:12:03.757 --> 01:12:05.547
Get rich doing that.

01:12:11.297 --> 01:12:13.127
My health isn't the hottest.

01:12:14.047 --> 01:12:16.257
It only took days for them to fire me.

01:12:25.507 --> 01:12:27.667
Each person walks their own path.

01:12:28.087 --> 01:12:30.087
No one wishes to disappoint their dad.

01:12:34.547 --> 01:12:36.467
I haven't forgotten my promise.

01:12:37.717 --> 01:12:39.547
I promise he would be happy.

01:12:55.837 --> 01:12:56.917
Dad?

01:12:58.047 --> 01:12:59.587
You still see me as "Dad"?

01:13:07.717 --> 01:13:08.717
Dad...

01:13:08.877 --> 01:13:09.877
I am sorry.

01:13:11.297 --> 01:13:12.667
I don't need your sorry.

01:13:14.377 --> 01:13:15.757
I just need you to go to rehab.

01:13:28.337 --> 01:13:29.417
If you don't...

01:13:30.547 --> 01:13:31.967
then pick another dad.

01:13:38.417 --> 01:13:39.417
Let go of me.

01:13:42.377 --> 01:13:43.417
Let go now!

01:13:45.837 --> 01:13:47.087
Or I'll smack you.

01:13:47.877 --> 01:13:48.917
If you still can,

01:13:49.467 --> 01:13:50.627
just smack me, I'll be happy.

01:13:52.757 --> 01:13:53.877
You're testing me, boy?

01:13:55.087 --> 01:13:56.087
Let go!

01:13:56.507 --> 01:13:58.337
Let go! Get off of me!

01:14:00.087 --> 01:14:02.047
You! You! You!

01:14:02.297 --> 01:14:03.837
Testing me! Testing me!

01:14:04.257 --> 01:14:05.257
Speak up, please!

01:14:05.377 --> 01:14:07.337
Testing me! Testing me, huh?

01:14:07.587 --> 01:14:09.377
- Lanh!
- Testing me!

01:14:09.467 --> 01:14:11.547
Good gods! Lanh!

01:14:11.877 --> 01:14:14.127
Just speak up!

01:14:14.547 --> 01:14:15.917
I have cancer, terminal.

01:14:22.047 --> 01:14:25.217
Testing me! Testing me, huh?

01:14:25.417 --> 01:14:26.417
Testing me, huh?

01:14:26.547 --> 01:14:27.547
Testing me, huh?

01:14:27.587 --> 01:14:29.756
- Testing me! Testing me!
- Speak up!

01:14:29.757 --> 01:14:31.797
- Testing me, huh?
- Lanh!

01:14:32.127 --> 01:14:34.507
Speak up, please!

01:14:35.127 --> 01:14:38.257
I want to have money...
a lot of money.

01:14:39.877 --> 01:14:42.297
So my dad can live well
long after I'm gone.

01:14:42.717 --> 01:14:43.717
Testing me!

01:14:43.837 --> 01:14:44.837
Testing me!

01:14:44.967 --> 01:14:45.797
Testing me, huh?

01:14:45.967 --> 01:14:47.717
Testing me, huh?
Testing me, huh?

01:14:47.917 --> 01:14:49.666
Lanh! Lanh...!

01:14:49.667 --> 01:14:52.717
Speak... up!

01:14:53.217 --> 01:14:54.507
I'm no addict.

01:14:54.757 --> 01:14:58.417
My injections are prescribed painkillers.

01:15:01.797 --> 01:15:03.967
My time is almost up.

01:15:04.967 --> 01:15:06.547
- Lanh!
- Test me, huh?

01:15:15.587 --> 01:15:18.967
How I've spoiled my child!

01:15:19.257 --> 01:15:20.257
Lanh?

01:15:20.587 --> 01:15:22.127
I'm sorry, dad...

01:15:23.837 --> 01:15:24.837
Lanh!

01:15:25.337 --> 01:15:26.337
Lanh!

01:15:44.587 --> 01:15:45.627
Thank you, doctor.

01:15:57.967 --> 01:15:59.797
His usual painkillers became weaker,

01:16:00.127 --> 01:16:03.046
and so he switched to those injections.

01:16:03.047 --> 01:16:05.967
And yet we both thought ill of him.

01:16:06.757 --> 01:16:09.297
He's always been the sweetest kid.

01:16:09.967 --> 01:16:13.877
Only recently did he change.
Everything has its reasons, you see.

01:16:30.337 --> 01:16:31.337
Babe?

01:16:31.377 --> 01:16:32.417
My ultrasound scan.

01:16:32.717 --> 01:16:33.717
A boy?

01:16:34.047 --> 01:16:35.047
A girl.

01:16:37.297 --> 01:16:37.877
Abort it.

01:16:37.878 --> 01:16:39.587
But she is yours and mine.

01:16:42.297 --> 01:16:43.337
Your dime.

01:16:43.757 --> 01:16:45.047
- But then...
- Hey!

01:16:45.467 --> 01:16:47.217
In this house, no "if"s or "but"s.

01:16:47.717 --> 01:16:49.797
If there are any "but"s, scram!

01:16:51.797 --> 01:16:52.967
You old bastard!

01:16:54.837 --> 01:16:57.587
Bastard! Let me go! Let me go!

01:16:59.297 --> 01:17:00.337
Let me go!

01:17:02.667 --> 01:17:03.667
Let me go!

01:17:03.757 --> 01:17:05.667
You bastard! Karma will get you!

01:17:06.297 --> 01:17:06.917
Hello?

01:17:07.167 --> 01:17:08.167
What's up?

01:17:08.717 --> 01:17:11.006
Here's my red book,
my land's paperwork.

01:17:11.007 --> 01:17:13.757
I'm in need of 100 million VND
to treat my son.

01:17:14.337 --> 01:17:15.417
OK. Sure!

01:17:15.627 --> 01:17:19.417
But let's take care of
your son's old debt first.

01:17:20.217 --> 01:17:22.877
As for the rest, I'll take
17% interest, monthly.

01:17:23.417 --> 01:17:24.417
Sure.

01:18:27.337 --> 01:18:29.127
Shower's ready, boy!

01:18:48.917 --> 01:18:54.167
Left, left side.
To the left a bit, dad.

01:19:02.467 --> 01:19:05.086
I've cleaned you until
you got into ninth grade, remember?

01:19:05.087 --> 01:19:06.587
I can do it myself.

01:19:07.047 --> 01:19:08.377
Stop acting shy!

01:19:09.217 --> 01:19:10.217
Sit!

01:19:11.257 --> 01:19:13.627
Dang smelly hair, how clean you are!

01:20:13.047 --> 01:20:14.047
Something wrong?

01:20:24.837 --> 01:20:25.837
It hurts...

01:20:27.837 --> 01:20:28.837
It hurts...

01:20:33.257 --> 01:20:34.257
It hurts...

01:21:00.417 --> 01:21:03.167
Should we let Lanh
get his treatment abroad?

01:21:05.047 --> 01:21:06.757
We'll need a lot of money, though.

01:21:09.507 --> 01:21:10.507
What?

01:21:10.917 --> 01:21:11.917
1.7 billion VND?

01:21:12.837 --> 01:21:14.667
How the hell is that
your house's price tag?

01:21:15.127 --> 01:21:17.627
Frankly, I'm desperate, hence that number.

01:21:18.257 --> 01:21:21.837
That number I gave you
is actually below market value.

01:21:22.127 --> 01:21:23.877
- 700 million.
- Holy heavens!

01:21:24.377 --> 01:21:25.797
That just won't do.

01:21:26.127 --> 01:21:28.047
Treatment for cancer is costly!

01:21:28.797 --> 01:21:30.417
See if there's another way.

01:21:32.127 --> 01:21:32.667
Fine.

01:21:33.087 --> 01:21:34.627
Find another buyer, it's fine.

01:21:34.837 --> 01:21:35.917
But nowadays...

01:21:36.627 --> 01:21:37.627
I bet you that,

01:21:38.007 --> 01:21:39.127
three months later,

01:21:39.837 --> 01:21:41.547
your house will still be on sale.

01:22:03.297 --> 01:22:04.297
What're you doing, dad?

01:22:06.007 --> 01:22:07.007
Oh...!

01:22:07.417 --> 01:22:10.417
Uh... it's an application,
for me to go to college.

01:22:11.587 --> 01:22:13.217
You plan to woo the teacher?

01:22:13.877 --> 01:22:15.007
How can I?

01:22:15.167 --> 01:22:17.167
The teacher's mom already rejected me.

01:22:30.507 --> 01:22:31.876
- Here, here.
- I'm doing it!

01:22:31.877 --> 01:22:33.047
Let me do it...

01:22:33.587 --> 01:22:34.717
You sit and rest.

01:22:41.047 --> 01:22:42.257
Another chore, dad?

01:22:42.967 --> 01:22:43.967
I've time to spare.

01:22:45.757 --> 01:22:47.467
Turn the pillow over for me.

01:22:48.917 --> 01:22:50.297
Got bedbugs or what?

01:22:53.467 --> 01:22:54.087
Huh?

01:22:54.257 --> 01:22:55.467
That's my gift to you.

01:22:56.297 --> 01:22:57.877
My most valuable item.

01:22:58.757 --> 01:22:59.957
When I'm gone, please open it.

01:23:01.547 --> 01:23:03.547
Nonsense sentiment,
no sense in opening!

01:23:04.507 --> 01:23:05.547
I'll leave it here, then.

01:23:05.627 --> 01:23:07.087
Remember: Upon death, unwrap!

01:23:07.507 --> 01:23:08.917
Stop repeating crap!

01:23:09.837 --> 01:23:11.796
I crave broken rice, oh, old scholar!

01:23:11.797 --> 01:23:12.876
Forget it.

01:23:12.877 --> 01:23:14.257
Broken rice, please, old scholar!

01:23:14.587 --> 01:23:17.467
- Eat crap!
- Me want rice, though.

01:23:21.337 --> 01:23:22.497
Scallion oil, a bit or a lot?

01:23:22.837 --> 01:23:24.087
Just a bit, old scholar!

01:23:45.547 --> 01:23:49.717
Certificate. My son,
Tran Van Lanh

01:23:50.047 --> 01:23:53.797
is hereby awarded the title
"Father's Finest Boy"

01:23:54.757 --> 01:23:58.167
Your dad, Tran Van Dao.

01:24:44.877 --> 01:24:45.877
Lanh, child!

01:24:46.837 --> 01:24:48.047
- Miss Sau.
- Lanh.

01:24:48.667 --> 01:24:50.417
Made herbal chicken stew for you.

01:24:50.837 --> 01:24:52.667
- Hey, it's real hot!
- Thank you much.

01:24:53.167 --> 01:24:54.167
- Miss Sau!
- Eh?

01:24:54.257 --> 01:24:55.967
- Hang around a bit.
- Make it quick.

01:24:56.087 --> 01:24:57.587
I have cakes to make.

01:24:57.797 --> 01:24:58.797
Smells good!

01:25:08.167 --> 01:25:09.257
- Miss Sau...
- Yes?

01:25:09.837 --> 01:25:11.007
You dig my dad, yes?

01:25:12.417 --> 01:25:13.417
How silly...

01:25:16.467 --> 01:25:17.467
What?

01:25:18.337 --> 01:25:19.337
Miss Sau...

01:25:20.587 --> 01:25:22.297
I'm passing my dad to you.

01:26:14.121 --> 01:26:17.910
[Certifcation of Dad's finest boy]

01:26:33.257 --> 01:26:34.587
How are you still here?

01:26:34.757 --> 01:26:36.007
Flight got delayed?

01:26:38.007 --> 01:26:40.627
Don't want you to go solo.
So I'm waiting for you.

01:26:40.797 --> 01:26:41.837
How nice!

01:26:45.297 --> 01:26:46.297
Lanh...?

01:26:46.507 --> 01:26:46.967
Huh?

01:26:47.167 --> 01:26:48.167
Joking aside...

01:26:48.547 --> 01:26:50.337
I've led so much chaos to you both,

01:26:51.087 --> 01:26:52.837
so I'm still here to set things right.

01:26:53.837 --> 01:26:55.257
Help me find 3 billion then.

01:27:00.297 --> 01:27:01.757
Help me find my health.

01:27:05.667 --> 01:27:06.837
I kid!

01:27:07.047 --> 01:27:08.047
Lighten up.

01:27:09.127 --> 01:27:11.467
Had I gotten more time,

01:27:12.877 --> 01:27:14.627
or gotten more health,

01:27:17.797 --> 01:27:20.167
I would have done more
for my loved ones.

01:27:37.257 --> 01:27:37.877
Yo, Dao!

01:27:38.167 --> 01:27:39.297
Who died?

01:27:40.087 --> 01:27:41.336
What the hell, boy?

01:27:41.337 --> 01:27:42.377
Let's hit the beach!

01:27:42.627 --> 01:27:43.627
Huh?

01:27:44.717 --> 01:27:47.217
[Phu Quoc beach]

01:29:05.377 --> 01:29:06.917
You're feeling OK, son?

01:29:07.957 --> 01:29:09.257
A little better, dad.

01:29:10.627 --> 01:29:11.627
Dao!

01:29:12.207 --> 01:29:13.257
Yes, Mr. Nghi?

01:29:18.757 --> 01:29:20.797
Where is the house's
interest for this month?

01:29:21.507 --> 01:29:23.667
You're two weeks past due.

01:29:24.207 --> 01:29:25.666
Please give me two more days.

01:29:25.667 --> 01:29:26.167
Không.

01:29:26.587 --> 01:29:28.796
You must have it now,
I don't care how.

01:29:28.797 --> 01:29:29.797
Dad?

01:29:31.297 --> 01:29:32.797
When did our house become collateral?

01:29:33.337 --> 01:29:36.047
If he hadn't done that,
you wouldn't have any meds.

01:29:36.667 --> 01:29:39.667
- Please understand. Just two m...
- Just shut up.

01:29:39.837 --> 01:29:40.837
I'm seizing the house.

01:29:41.007 --> 01:29:43.126
- I beg you. Don't.
- Dad?

01:29:43.127 --> 01:29:45.707
- No need to beg!
- It's my place. You get out!

01:29:52.047 --> 01:29:53.047
Get off!

01:29:56.127 --> 01:29:57.127
Motherfucker!

01:30:20.877 --> 01:30:21.877
Lanh!

01:30:39.917 --> 01:30:41.957
I'll pay!

01:30:51.877 --> 01:30:53.797
Plus interest, it's 126 million VND.

01:30:57.507 --> 01:30:58.707
Our red book?

01:30:59.207 --> 01:31:00.757
Hold your horses!

01:31:01.757 --> 01:31:02.837
What about it?

01:31:04.797 --> 01:31:06.047
What about my money?

01:31:06.207 --> 01:31:08.337
Plus interest, it's over 60 mil!

01:31:08.627 --> 01:31:09.417
Damn.

01:31:09.627 --> 01:31:11.667
Seems like I can't return your book yet.

01:31:12.207 --> 01:31:14.587
Hey, buddy! If you need money,

01:31:15.047 --> 01:31:17.667
come and see me.
I'll show you ways to pay.

01:31:17.917 --> 01:31:18.917
Otherwise?

01:31:19.377 --> 01:31:21.337
This house will surely be mine.

01:31:26.667 --> 01:31:28.087
What a good son you are!

01:31:58.837 --> 01:32:00.297
Are you mad at me?

01:32:04.337 --> 01:32:06.337
But... where did you get all this money?

01:32:07.797 --> 01:32:09.507
This would have been all for you.

01:32:17.797 --> 01:32:19.547
I don't need all this.

01:32:21.957 --> 01:32:23.797
I just need you to be well.

01:32:33.297 --> 01:32:34.917
But now I don't know that...

01:32:37.877 --> 01:32:39.797
if we can't retrieve the book...

01:32:41.877 --> 01:32:43.007
where will you live?

01:32:56.547 --> 01:32:57.547
Uh, boss?

01:32:57.707 --> 01:33:00.666
His house at 1.7 billion, that's cheap!
Why isn't it yours yet?

01:33:00.667 --> 01:33:02.087
You're brainless and hairless, huh?

01:33:02.917 --> 01:33:05.417
I'm getting that house for free.

01:33:19.440 --> 01:33:21.317
But... where did you get all this money?

01:33:24.937 --> 01:33:26.755
Plus interest, it's 126 million VND.

01:33:27.207 --> 01:33:29.296
This would have been all for you.

01:33:29.297 --> 01:33:31.876
Let me ask you: If folks give
you cash, will you take it?

01:33:31.877 --> 01:33:33.836
You are dead...
so why this need to find her?

01:33:33.837 --> 01:33:35.336
Don't you remember
how much money did you make!?

01:33:35.337 --> 01:33:37.626
21.2 mil! What is left now?

01:33:37.627 --> 01:33:40.007
If you have ghostly help, prove it to me.

01:33:40.457 --> 01:33:41.457
See if I'll get hurt.

01:33:52.957 --> 01:33:54.706
You come up with something quick.

01:33:54.707 --> 01:33:56.877
Lanh's cancer won't wait for you.

01:33:57.167 --> 01:33:58.167
It hurts!

01:34:06.047 --> 01:34:07.457
Lanh? Lanh?

01:34:08.007 --> 01:34:10.087
- Get up, hear me out.
- What's wrong, dad?

01:34:12.797 --> 01:34:13.797
At any cost...

01:34:14.207 --> 01:34:17.046
I will score big
to pay for your treatment abroad.

01:34:17.047 --> 01:34:18.297
You can't do that.

01:34:18.957 --> 01:34:21.007
- Where there's a will, a way.
- Stop.

01:34:21.917 --> 01:34:22.917
You...!

01:34:23.457 --> 01:34:24.917
I'm your son, not a slapping bag.

01:34:25.127 --> 01:34:28.507
No parent will leave
their sick child untreated!

01:34:28.797 --> 01:34:29.797
Fine...

01:34:30.417 --> 01:34:31.707
How will you "score big"?

01:34:31.837 --> 01:34:33.256
- Loan sharks?
- No.

01:34:33.257 --> 01:34:34.706
- Sell the house?
- No.

01:34:34.707 --> 01:34:37.167
- So how then?
- Your ghostly friend.

01:34:39.957 --> 01:34:40.957
No.

01:34:41.917 --> 01:34:44.257
I won't put your life at risk!

01:34:44.757 --> 01:34:45.837
- Lanh...
- No!

01:34:47.547 --> 01:34:49.047
- Lanh!
- Shhh!

01:34:58.547 --> 01:34:59.547
Lanh? Lanh?

01:35:00.837 --> 01:35:02.797
Can we discuss it a bit more?

01:35:07.047 --> 01:35:09.206
Lanh... just try this.

01:35:09.207 --> 01:35:12.047
Are you sure I'll be at risk?
The ghost could just be teasing!

01:35:12.457 --> 01:35:15.506
I've visited a shaman.
I'm well-blessed! Stop worrying!

01:35:15.507 --> 01:35:16.667
Please just stop, dad.

01:35:17.127 --> 01:35:19.087
Child, I've lived this long.

01:35:19.507 --> 01:35:21.877
Sad, joy, good, bad.
I've met them all.

01:35:22.087 --> 01:35:23.667
Women, too. That box is ticked.

01:35:24.007 --> 01:35:26.797
Have you, though?
If not, then you must live!

01:35:26.957 --> 01:35:28.957
But my doctor gave the word.

01:35:31.167 --> 01:35:32.797
"One day to go"
is "one day to live"!

01:35:32.957 --> 01:35:36.007
My living days are
my painful days, dad.

01:35:38.667 --> 01:35:41.707
- If you go, who'll keep me company?
- There's me on the altar!

01:35:43.507 --> 01:35:46.547
- Don't you fear death?
- My fear is you suffering.

01:35:48.087 --> 01:35:49.877
Life already handed me my card.

01:35:50.127 --> 01:35:53.797
- There's no changing it.
- Change how you play that card!

01:35:54.337 --> 01:35:55.416
Stop, dad.

01:35:55.417 --> 01:35:56.167
Lanh!

01:35:56.168 --> 01:35:58.256
Keep talking about cards,
I'll call the cops on you!

01:35:58.257 --> 01:36:00.837
I'll kick you downstream,
you stubborn bull!

01:36:01.007 --> 01:36:03.757
You're my son, not a bison!

01:36:06.127 --> 01:36:08.206
Seems like I can't return
your book yet.

01:36:08.207 --> 01:36:12.257
If you need money, come and see me.
I'll show you ways to pay.

01:36:12.507 --> 01:36:15.957
Otherwise? This house will surely be mine.

01:36:25.507 --> 01:36:28.377
Na? You once said "laws of the Dead
are firm unless..."

01:36:29.417 --> 01:36:32.547
This "unless"... means
there's a loophole, yes?

01:36:40.047 --> 01:36:41.047
Dad?

01:36:41.377 --> 01:36:42.797
Don't "dad" me right now.

01:36:43.667 --> 01:36:45.417
- Would you die for me?
- Yes!

01:37:37.297 --> 01:37:38.297
Lanh!

01:37:38.757 --> 01:37:39.757
Let's go!

01:39:12.667 --> 01:39:13.667
Oh? Mister Dao!

01:39:14.667 --> 01:39:16.417
You're joining, too?

01:39:17.257 --> 01:39:20.457
Brothers! Make haste, bets in, let's go!

01:39:24.757 --> 01:39:26.142
I'm in for Bloom, 600 mil.

01:39:26.253 --> 01:39:27.147
Who's calling?

01:39:28.337 --> 01:39:29.707
Yo, that's huge, man!

01:39:33.883 --> 01:39:34.615
Lanh...

01:39:36.639 --> 01:39:37.862
Go all-in.

01:39:39.079 --> 01:39:40.079
One billion VND.

01:39:45.167 --> 01:39:47.087
One billion on Bloom!
Who's calling?

01:39:47.207 --> 01:39:48.207
Hell!

01:39:50.667 --> 01:39:51.707
You scared, Nghi?

01:39:56.757 --> 01:39:57.757
So?

01:39:58.627 --> 01:39:59.627
One billion.

01:40:02.627 --> 01:40:04.507
Your life is in my possession.

01:40:05.757 --> 01:40:07.127
Your game is also mine.

01:40:07.507 --> 01:40:10.587
So? Who else's with me?

01:40:14.877 --> 01:40:16.297
Is there anyone?

01:40:16.917 --> 01:40:17.917
Pooling in 200 mil!

01:40:18.757 --> 01:40:19.757
Who's that?

01:40:22.547 --> 01:40:23.547
You, Alex?

01:40:24.337 --> 01:40:25.337
Yes?

01:40:25.667 --> 01:40:26.667
In!

01:40:26.837 --> 01:40:28.257
- What's in?
- Your 200 mil.

01:40:30.507 --> 01:40:31.507
On which one?

01:40:31.508 --> 01:40:33.416
- Whichever's a chicken.
- All good, all good.

01:40:33.417 --> 01:40:35.957
Easy win! Easy win!

01:40:40.797 --> 01:40:41.916
Brothers!

01:40:41.917 --> 01:40:43.121
Bets in!

01:40:43.699 --> 01:40:44.432
Three...

01:40:44.574 --> 01:40:45.505
Two...

01:40:45.588 --> 01:40:46.267
one!

01:40:46.418 --> 01:40:47.609
Let go!

01:41:04.627 --> 01:41:06.507
Come on! Come on!

01:41:09.547 --> 01:41:11.207
Let's go! Kill your opponent!

01:42:31.337 --> 01:42:32.707
Lanh...

01:42:42.207 --> 01:42:43.257
Bloom wins!

01:42:45.127 --> 01:42:47.917
Bloom won! Your pick is it!

01:42:48.417 --> 01:42:49.917
Lanh! Bloom w...

01:42:58.257 --> 01:43:00.257
Why are you hurt and not me?

01:43:00.547 --> 01:43:04.087
Guys, help my son!
The rooster's spur slashed him!

01:43:04.457 --> 01:43:08.257
Please, I beg you! Please!

01:43:08.667 --> 01:43:09.667
Leave it in!

01:43:11.457 --> 01:43:13.457
Lanh, no!

01:44:07.377 --> 01:44:08.507
Hang on, son!

01:44:09.297 --> 01:44:11.007
I will get you to the ER.

01:44:11.627 --> 01:44:13.837
You must live. You have to.

01:44:15.007 --> 01:44:16.456
I won't make it...

01:44:16.457 --> 01:44:18.837
You will. At any cost, you will!

01:44:19.507 --> 01:44:21.337
You'll make it! You'll make it!

01:44:22.127 --> 01:44:23.457
At any cost, you will!

01:44:25.519 --> 01:44:26.450
Oh, dad?

01:44:26.877 --> 01:44:29.297
Your dream... is to be an embalmer?

01:44:30.377 --> 01:44:32.046
My dream is you, son.

01:44:32.047 --> 01:44:33.756
Then I promise to study real well...

01:44:33.757 --> 01:44:36.007
so I'll become rich
and take care of you!

01:44:40.087 --> 01:44:41.087
Lanh...

01:44:41.417 --> 01:44:42.547
Say something to me.

01:44:44.087 --> 01:44:45.087
Lanh...

01:44:45.507 --> 01:44:46.667
Say something, please.

01:44:47.757 --> 01:44:49.917
Say something to me!

01:44:50.797 --> 01:44:51.797
Lanh!

01:44:53.457 --> 01:44:54.457
Lanh!

01:44:55.667 --> 01:44:56.667
Lanh!

01:45:20.337 --> 01:45:21.337
Dad, are you OK?

01:45:24.667 --> 01:45:25.667
I'm here, son.

01:45:36.007 --> 01:45:37.917
And why are you here?

01:45:41.007 --> 01:45:42.917
You can see her, too?

01:45:43.917 --> 01:45:45.376
My poor niece...

01:45:45.377 --> 01:45:49.048
The birth... bled her out
so much. She got so weak.

01:45:50.757 --> 01:45:52.547
You're the only one I speak to here.

01:45:52.846 --> 01:45:55.386
I beg you, please handle her funeral.

01:45:56.156 --> 01:45:57.131
Miss Tu?

01:45:57.854 --> 01:45:59.512
And our house would love a child.

01:45:59.544 --> 01:46:01.282
You just give her to me.

01:46:01.837 --> 01:46:03.207
Na will never know.

01:46:04.257 --> 01:46:06.106
The ultrasound showed a girl.

01:46:06.130 --> 01:46:08.257
But it was actually a boy.

01:46:08.695 --> 01:46:09.695
Lanh...

01:46:10.500 --> 01:46:12.802
He is your baby.

01:47:53.587 --> 01:47:55.007
That's my gift to you.

01:47:57.257 --> 01:47:59.257
My most valuable item.

01:48:03.587 --> 01:48:05.507
When I'm gone, please open it.

01:48:18.717 --> 01:48:21.597
[Certifcation of Dad's finest boy]

01:48:21.622 --> 01:48:25.014
[Awarded to Tran Van Lanh.
By your dad, Tran Van Dao.]

01:48:36.589 --> 01:48:39.228
Police.

01:48:40.048 --> 01:48:41.218
Freeze!

01:48:42.174 --> 01:48:43.004
Sit down!

01:51:59.633 --> 01:52:04.742
BETTING WITH GHOST
